Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.97,0:00:02.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}＜游马：中了水母怪人的毒牙
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.92,0:00:04.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼和璃绪陷入濒死状态。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.24,0:00:07.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}两人获救的方法就是在决斗中获胜。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.77,0:00:11.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}此时出现的是曾经的宿敌 {\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅳ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.26,0:00:13.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现在 鲨鱼和{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅳ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.32,0:00:14.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}双人决斗开始了！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.48,0:00:20.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}({\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅳ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe})这到底是怎么回事！？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.22,0:00:23.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙的水母 No.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.48,0:00:24.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}明明已经被破坏掉了{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.82,0:00:27.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}居然变成了两只！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.23,0:00:29.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到底 为什么…。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.91,0:00:33.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动了猛毒刺胞 水母水螅的效果。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.20,0:00:34.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动了哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.74,0:00:36.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这家伙被破坏的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.27,0:00:38.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}按照超量怪兽的数量{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.52,0:00:39.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从额外卡组或墓地
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.94,0:00:42.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将名字带有水母水螅的怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.55,0:00:44.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤出来。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.23,0:00:48.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}斯特尔斯·克拉肯的超量单位有2个。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.75,0:00:50.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因此我特殊召唤了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.04,0:00:53.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}2只斯特尔斯·克拉肯·艾菲拉。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.22,0:00:55.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啧……居然有这种效果。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.67,0:00:57.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且，通过这个效果特殊召唤的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.74,0:01:00.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}斯特尔斯·克拉肯·艾菲拉{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.26,0:01:02.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}会各获得1个被破坏的斯特尔斯·克拉肯的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.77,0:01:04.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量单位。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.73,0:01:06.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后，这只艾菲拉也
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.24,0:01:08.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}拥有和斯特尔斯·克拉肯相同的效果。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.93,0:01:11.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你不知道吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.55,0:01:14.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在克拉肯里面啊，有自己分裂成两个
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.90,0:01:16.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再再生回原本个体的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.77,0:01:18.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超厉害的前辈哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.96,0:01:22.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且还有即使老化也会变年轻不老不死的前辈。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.34,0:01:24.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}更惊人的还在后面。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.08,0:01:27.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那些前辈们既没有心脏也没有大脑！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.46,0:01:31.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没有脑子啊别嚣张了！笨蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.59,0:01:35.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂 我再问你一次！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.26,0:01:37.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你是哪个中学的！？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.23,0:01:39.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦啦哦啦哦啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.04,0:01:41.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《话虽如此
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.44,0:01:44.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那个水母怪兽 效果真麻烦啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.29,0:01:48.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但至少现在得削掉那家伙的生命值！》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.84,0:01:51.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 发动巨神兵的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.31,0:01:53.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}使用1个超量素材{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.95,0:01:56.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将场上除巨神兵以外的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.36,0:01:58.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所有怪兽全部破坏！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.31,0:02:03.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}粉碎吧 水母混蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.48,0:02:05.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且 将那只怪兽的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.03,0:02:07.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力合计数值的伤害{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.37,0:02:09.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}给予对方玩家！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.77,0:02:12.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}破坏炮！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.30,0:02:22.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么样？那家伙的生命值
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.15,0:02:24.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被我削掉了3800哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.98,0:02:25.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}三哥！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.49,0:02:30.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但我发动 艾菲拉的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.84,0:02:32.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}首先从墓地复活
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.83,0:02:35.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.4 幽冥克拉肯。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.58,0:02:36.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后第三只
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.51,0:02:39.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}幽冥克拉肯·艾菲拉 特殊召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.49,0:02:46.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.42,0:02:49.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要把这个世界全都用克拉肯填满吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.29,0:02:54.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我盖一张卡 回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.77,0:02:58.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来不管破坏那家伙多少只怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.70,0:02:59.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}都会再次复活！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.38,0:03:01.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到底该怎么办……
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.59,0:03:05.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《凌牙：这场决斗我绝不能输。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.00,0:03:08.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}璃绪我一定会救出来！》
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.90,0:04:44.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(小鸟)游马 璃绪小姐的状态
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.53,0:04:46.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}越来越糟糕了。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.94,0:04:49.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(小鸟)连医生也束手无策……
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.39,0:04:51.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}求你了…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.33,0:04:52.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快救救他！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.57,0:04:54.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.87,0:04:56.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}糟了。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.49,0:04:58.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样下去 还没分出胜负{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.15,0:05:00.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}搞不好两个人都会没命！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.46,0:05:02.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.99,0:05:05.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}太卑鄙了 库拉格！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.58,0:05:07.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}堂堂正正地决胜负！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.18,0:05:13.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}凌牙！ 你要是输了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.38,0:05:15.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你妹妹也会没命的！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.49,0:05:18.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只有这个规则已经没法改了！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.70,0:05:20.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那就你只能赢了啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.54,0:05:22.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不管是什么状态！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.44,0:05:24.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凌牙)你在跟谁说话…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.36,0:05:29.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我怎么可能输给库拉格那混蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.99,0:05:30.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.00,0:05:34.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《但这家伙说实话真够呛。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.95,0:05:36.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的身体也不知道能撑到什么时候……。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.39,0:05:41.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且就算把那水母怪兽破坏掉
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.01,0:05:42.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也会一个接一个地复活。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.40,0:05:46.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要打倒那家伙就必须一击削掉它的生命值……。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.93,0:05:48.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}既然如此……》
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.12,0:05:54.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《深渊·飞溅……
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.51,0:05:56.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如果是那些 No.卡的话……》
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.04,0:05:58.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合！抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.44,0:06:04.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将怪兽以里侧守备表示盖放。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.62,0:06:06.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}里侧守备？怎么了，凌牙！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.76,0:06:08.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}刚才那股气势哪去了！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.88,0:06:11.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从这个回合开始就可以攻击了啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.03,0:06:14.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不管那水母混蛋的怪兽有多不死{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.51,0:06:17.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就像我一样用拳头打进去啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.62,0:06:20.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.65,0:06:23.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}内讧吗？真难看啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.73,0:06:27.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动永续陷阱卡 退潮！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.65,0:06:31.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡在玩家将怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.11,0:06:33.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}以里侧守备表示盖放时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.56,0:06:35.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}变为表侧守备表示！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.33,0:06:39.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且 此时反转效果不会发动。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.30,0:06:43.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么？ 放弃水属性改用暗属性？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.97,0:06:45.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是害怕
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.02,0:06:46.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}斯特尔克·库拉肯的怪兽效果吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.38,0:06:49.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂 后辈。真卑鄙啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.71,0:06:52.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}虽然不甘心 但确实如此。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.06,0:06:55.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙 到底是怎么了？ 凌牙！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.41,0:06:57.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}吵死了…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.18,0:06:59.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 就这样 回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.00,0:07:02.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《啧… 视线开始模糊了。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.40,0:07:04.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 现在只能忍耐。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.40,0:07:07.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}直到一口气将那家伙击溃的机会到来…》
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.36,0:07:10.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哼！ 苟延残喘的鲨鱼混蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.43,0:07:13.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.33,0:07:15.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我来让你解脱吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.59,0:07:18.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动魔法卡 水母·水雨。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.19,0:07:21.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}场上的怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.12,0:07:22.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}全部变成水属性。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.14,0:07:23.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}({\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅳ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}/凌牙)什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.33,0:07:26.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(水母)这样一来 你们的怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.29,0:07:27.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就无法从水母的毒牙下
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.39,0:07:28.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}逃脱了。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.69,0:07:34.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你们 我来给你们致命一击。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.39,0:07:37.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}首先从特隆的蠢儿子开始！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.41,0:07:41.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.4 不死水母·克拉肯的效果 发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.81,0:07:43.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}双方的回合各一次
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.42,0:07:45.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}破坏1只水属性怪兽。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.36,0:07:50.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将其攻击力数值的伤害给予对方。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.16,0:07:53.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}承受巨神杀手攻击力
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.09,0:07:55.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}1500的伤害吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.58,0:08:05.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}接下来 轮到你了。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.99,0:08:07.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼混蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.86,0:08:10.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不死水母·艾菲拉的效果 发动。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.09,0:08:13.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}破坏骷髅章鱼。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.05,0:08:16.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}接下它600攻击力的伤害吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.59,0:08:19.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不妙…鲨鱼的LP是400…。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.28,0:08:21.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要是挨下那招…。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.85,0:08:29.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}陷阱发动！缩小阴影！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.62,0:08:32.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}使场上1只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.46,0:08:34.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因效果造成的破坏无效化。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.09,0:08:37.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅳ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe} 你这家伙…。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.28,0:08:44.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啧 那就战斗…你这混蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.42,0:08:46.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我要从你身上刺一刀。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.22,0:08:49.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.4！用寂静荣誉方舟骑士
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.77,0:08:51.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击骷髅章鱼。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.79,0:08:53.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}触手突袭！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.46,0:08:56.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不妙…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.94,0:08:58.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}凌牙的场上空无一物…。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.19,0:09:02.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用寂静荣誉方舟骑士·厄菲拉直接攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.48,0:09:04.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}凌牙！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.34,0:09:08.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}陷阱发动。深渊电流！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.81,0:09:11.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将对手1只怪兽的直接攻击
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.54,0:09:13.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无效并结束战斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.25,0:09:16.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是个难缠的家伙。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.99,0:09:20.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我盖伏两张卡，回合结束！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.45,0:09:28.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅳ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}）凌牙！！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.68,0:09:29.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼！！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.91,0:09:32.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}璃绪小姐……
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.76,0:09:35.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马，璃绪小姐的情况……
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.29,0:09:37.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}已经没时间了……
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.41,0:09:42.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼……撑住！救你妹妹啊！！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.86,0:09:47.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《璃绪……》
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.76,0:09:54.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《身体不听使唤了。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.89,0:09:56.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}璃绪……
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.58,0:09:59.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我难道救不了你吗》
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.51,0:10:02.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼……
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.97,0:10:03.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}凌牙……
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.73,0:10:07.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你干嘛这么没出息地倒着？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.85,0:10:10.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂，废物家伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.97,0:10:12.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这次轮到我的粉丝服务
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.62,0:10:14.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让你好好享受个够了！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.34,0:10:17.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合，抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.87,0:10:21.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}当我的生命值在2000以下时 魔法卡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.31,0:10:24.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动傀儡仪式 帕佩特·利彻尔！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.96,0:10:25.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将我墓地里的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.94,0:10:28.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}1只机关傀儡怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.04,0:10:28.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.04,0:10:31.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}复活吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.82,0:10:35.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}机关傀儡 巨杀者！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.66,0:10:41.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}切！ 那种怪兽就算复活了{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.59,0:10:43.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也打不倒我的怪兽。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.35,0:10:46.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别慌 废物家伙。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.03,0:10:49.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}通过将我场上的怪兽作为超量素材
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.13,0:10:50.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}释放{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.50,0:10:53.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从手牌将 机关傀儡 梦魇
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.22,0:10:54.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.03,0:10:59.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}通过这个效果特殊召唤的 梦魇{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.64,0:11:01.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将作为2个超量素材。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.13,0:11:04.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上啊 兄长大人！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.08,0:11:06.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅳ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}……。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.60,0:11:09.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我是等级8的暗属性
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.23,0:11:12.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用机关傀儡·梦魇进行叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.62,0:11:15.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用两只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.86,0:11:17.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建叠放网络！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.65,0:11:19.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.81,0:11:24.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧，No.40！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.37,0:11:33.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}机关傀儡·天堂弦乐手！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.34,0:11:36.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}天堂弦乐手……
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.50,0:11:38.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}能行！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.06,0:11:40.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}天堂弦乐手的攻击力是3000。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.30,0:11:42.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且只要使用怪兽效果的话……
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.82,0:11:44.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}休想！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.69,0:11:48.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动永续陷阱 果冻束缚。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.63,0:11:52.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}当我场上有水属性怪兽存在时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.18,0:11:55.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}以对方1只怪兽为对象发动。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.03,0:11:59.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我选择天堂弦乐手。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.78,0:12:03.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}成为对象的怪兽既不能攻击
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.88,0:12:06.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也不能使用怪兽效果。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.81,0:12:10.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.84,0:12:15.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来 你这家伙的怪兽就简直成了 废物人偶…。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.96,0:12:19.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我盖放一张卡 回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.67,0:12:24.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 鲨鱼混蛋！ 轮到你了。怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.30,0:12:28.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是这样吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.90,0:12:31.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等水母的毒蔓延全身的时候…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.90,0:12:33.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你已经连站都站不起来了吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.80,0:12:36.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}凌牙！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.81,0:12:39.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}干得漂亮！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.55,0:12:42.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}水母把鲨鱼给打趴下了！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.70,0:12:43.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.00,0:12:45.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}凌牙…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.79,0:12:51.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}原来是这么回事啊。你这家伙 就只有这种程度吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.67,0:12:55.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}连一个妹妹都救不了就是个没用的哥哥吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.66,0:12:57.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}站起来 凌牙！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.34,0:12:59.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅳ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}！ 你…。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.16,0:13:02.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼究竟有多么他有多为妹妹着想{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.23,0:13:04.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你到底 懂什么……
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.33,0:13:05.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我知道！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.01,0:13:08.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我知道啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.77,0:13:10.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙的事 我比谁都……。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.82,0:13:14.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}曾经 是我给他设下了陷阱……
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.18,0:13:17.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且伤害了他妹妹的人
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.93,0:13:18.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也是我。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.04,0:13:22.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错 那是我连同脸上的伤一起{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.20,0:13:24.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要背负一辈子的东西。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.67,0:13:26.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以 我懂。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.98,0:13:29.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙比任何人都 比为自己还
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.59,0:13:31.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为妹妹着想 一直战斗至今。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.64,0:13:33.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅳ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哥哥……。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.15,0:13:36.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且…… 还不止这些。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.75,0:13:41.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我啊 多亏了游马和那家伙多管闲事。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.56,0:13:44.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}才能夺回家人。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.88,0:13:47.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅳ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe} 你……
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.81,0:13:49.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以站起来吧 凌牙。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.45,0:13:52.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你为了家人一直在战斗着。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.79,0:13:56.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你才不是那种会放弃妹妹
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.14,0:13:58.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后死掉的的男人吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.59,0:13:59.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}凌牙那家伙啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.91,0:14:04.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}站起来 凌牙！！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.99,0:14:07.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（凌牙）
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.63,0:14:08.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.06,0:14:10.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}虽然不知道是谁{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.40,0:14:13.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有个吵得要死的家伙在……
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.94,0:14:16.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}笨……笨蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.85,0:14:19.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样哪能安安稳稳地睡觉啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.19,0:14:22.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.01,0:14:27.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那就赶紧把决斗结束掉{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.30,0:14:28.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后好好睡一觉吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.02,0:14:30.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊 那我就这么做吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.44,0:14:33.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《璃绪 我来救你》
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.87,0:14:35.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.91,0:14:43.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动 永续魔法 水神护符。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.49,0:14:46.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我场上的水属性怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.82,0:14:49.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不会成为对手的魔法 陷阱 怪兽效果的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.71,0:14:50.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对象。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.14,0:14:53.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼咬住的猎物绝不松口。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.90,0:14:54.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}直到咬碎为止！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.47,0:14:57.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从手牌发动魔法卡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.01,0:14:58.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}亚特兰蒂斯的威光。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.82,0:15:01.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这个回合召唤的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.59,0:15:03.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}水属性怪兽的等级
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.54,0:15:05.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以提升２级。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.57,0:15:08.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 在发动了通常魔法的回合
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.04,0:15:09.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以将这家伙特殊召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.39,0:15:12.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 大·乔斯。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.04,0:15:15.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动亚特兰蒂斯的威光的效果{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.38,0:15:17.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这个回合召唤的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.98,0:15:19.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}水属性怪兽的等级
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.82,0:15:21.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}提升２级。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.88,0:15:24.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}接着 我召唤了豹鲨。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.47,0:15:26.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这家伙在对方场上
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.72,0:15:28.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有2只以上怪兽的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.80,0:15:30.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不需要解放就能召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.09,0:15:35.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等级5的有2只！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.70,0:15:36.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来了啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.36,0:15:38.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好 上吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.51,0:15:41.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我用等级5的大乔兹和
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.69,0:15:43.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}豹鲨进行叠放。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.24,0:15:45.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用2只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.52,0:15:47.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建叠放网络。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.06,0:15:49.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.52,0:15:53.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧 No.73！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.02,0:15:57.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}坠入混沌的圣洁水滴。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.43,0:16:00.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}展现你的力量 净化混沌吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.43,0:16:04.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}激泷神 深渊溅射！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.38,0:16:10.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什…什么？ 这只怪兽是？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.82,0:16:14.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.73 深渊溅射。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.60,0:16:18.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在那座遗迹得到的 No.卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.08,0:16:22.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的记忆的…。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.97,0:16:27.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}神代凌牙。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.62,0:16:28.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}神代凌牙。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.07,0:16:33.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把璃绪夺回来！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.76,0:16:36.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅳ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe} 要赢啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.59,0:16:37.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.61,0:16:41.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}开什么玩笑，区区一个后辈。你们嗨什么嗨啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.34,0:16:44.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}陷阱卡发动，水母大厅！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.34,0:16:46.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对方玩家
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.45,0:16:48.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将水属性怪兽超量{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.67,0:16:50.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.03,0:16:51.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以发动。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.79,0:16:54.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这个回合，对方场上的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.40,0:16:55.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}表侧表示的卡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.94,0:16:57.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}全部无效。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.79,0:16:59.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}水神护符的卡牌效果也{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.80,0:17:02.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}深渊溅射的效果也全部无效！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.51,0:17:06.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来，就能发动前辈们的效果了。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.82,0:17:10.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.4 斯特尔斯·克拉肯的效果 发动。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.50,0:17:13.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}双方回合各一次 破坏场上
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.13,0:17:15.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}1只水属性怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.25,0:17:18.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将那个攻击力数值的伤害给予对手。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.89,0:17:21.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}粉碎吧！深渊飞溅。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.37,0:17:24.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那可不好说？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.18,0:17:25.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.46,0:17:30.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动速攻魔法 级联屏障！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.81,0:17:34.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}使我场上的1只怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.12,0:17:37.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因卡牌效果造成的破坏无效{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.77,0:17:42.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且 直到这个回合结束时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.68,0:17:45.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将那只怪兽的攻击力变为零。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.87,0:17:47.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那么另一只
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.89,0:17:51.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}斯特尔斯·克拉肯·艾菲拉的效果 发动。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.73,0:17:53.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}破坏深渊飞溅
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.43,0:17:55.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将攻击力数值的伤害给予对手。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.59,0:17:59.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}伤害虽然是零 但这样一来你的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.36,0:18:01.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}场上 就没有怪兽了。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.24,0:18:09.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}陷阱发动 天使之弦！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.28,0:18:14.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的场上存在1只名为诡计傀儡的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.04,0:18:15.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怪兽超量时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.33,0:18:19.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以从墓地特殊召唤1只
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.01,0:18:20.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怪兽超量。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.12,0:18:24.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我从凌牙的墓地
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.64,0:18:27.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}复活深渊吸盘！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.84,0:18:29.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好厉害 哥哥和鲨鱼。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.36,0:18:31.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这些家伙。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.28,0:18:33.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且 因为这个效果
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.09,0:18:35.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}天堂之弦{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.35,0:18:37.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}成为深渊吸盘的超量单位！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.38,0:18:42.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}深渊吸盘的效果 发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.03,0:18:46.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}使用1个超量单位 直到回合
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.12,0:18:48.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}结束时 攻击力变为2倍！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.68,0:18:53.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且我还使用另一个超量单位。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.36,0:18:57.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因此 攻击力是 倍之倍！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.76,0:19:02.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力 9600。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.65,0:19:06.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用深渊吸盘 攻击星辉克拉肯！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.52,0:19:07.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.41,0:19:10.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}最终降临！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.26,0:19:45.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}心率和血压都在恢复正常。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.65,0:19:47.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}难以置信。正在被解毒。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.14,0:19:50.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马，璃绪她。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.15,0:19:51.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.40,0:19:54.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼，妹妹也没事了！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.97,0:19:58.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是的净会给人添麻烦。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.39,0:20:02.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说到底你这家伙就是不够果断啊，凌牙。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.71,0:20:04.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你说什么，擅自跑出来
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.63,0:20:06.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}多管闲事，别开玩笑了！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.81,0:20:08.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还是老样子，一点都不可爱的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.64,0:20:09.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这个没死成的。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.27,0:20:12.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真不知道关系是好还是坏。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.57,0:20:16.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体……
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.32,0:20:18.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}((星光体：上吧，游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.28,0:20:19.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马，站起来！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.30,0:20:20.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你的选择是正确的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.37,0:20:22.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧 游马！))
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.01,0:20:24.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.16,0:20:27.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么可能 我居然。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.33,0:20:30.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}居然对那种混蛋。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.87,0:20:36.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊 难道说你是！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.32,0:20:42.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 干着缺德事被警察追的时候……
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.51,0:20:50.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被卷进了事故坐在那辆车上的小鬼。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.97,0:20:58.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 不可能啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.54,0:21:01.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}根本不可能啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.85,0:21:03.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你在说什么。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.85,0:21:06.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对了 我想起来了 神代凌牙。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.03,0:21:11.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊啊 后来我才知道
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.09,0:21:15.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那场事故里你们一家人应该全都死了。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.38,0:21:17.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错 应该都死了。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.13,0:21:19.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂 别开玩笑了。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.31,0:21:23.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么 本该已死的你们为什么……
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.85,0:21:25.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.54,0:21:29.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.76,0:21:38.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《怎么会…… 怎么会这样……
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.30,0:21:43.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这个家纹我在遗迹里看到的记忆之中。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.43,0:21:45.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}骗人的吧……》
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.46,0:21:46.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么了 凌牙。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.12,0:21:51.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《那个王家的家纹和我的……
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.03,0:21:53.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们一族的家纹一样》
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.29,0:21:55.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼……
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.53,0:21:58.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《怎么会……
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.93,0:22:00.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.17,0:22:03.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是巴利安吗？》
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.16,0:23:44.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.95,0:23:47.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.26,0:23:52.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.74,0:23:54.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.68,0:23:55.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.23,0:23:59.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.51,0:24:00.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.41,0:24:03.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.42,0:24:06.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.80,0:24:08.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
